	(text "Supply and charger (stand-ins)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.145 19.304 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2e9ab1d0-39cf-570c-bb52-46807aa7aa72")
	)
	(text "V102 stands for the 3.3 V regulator U2. B101 stands for the charger and the PD chip U1:\nVBUS is V101 (20, 15 or 12 V) while VSET is high, and 5 V while the limiter holds VSET low.\nIt follows VSET about 0.1 s late (R106, C106); the real chip's delay is not specified.\nVBUS rises during the first millisecond of a run."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 80.01 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8bdc2158-104b-52fe-808d-e217234547e7")
	)
	(text "Over-temperature limiter (second sensor)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.145 105.664 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7c0d9069-7a1b-582b-988c-889310712577")
	)
	(text "RT2 above 138 °C: LIM_N goes low and stays low until 127 °C (hysteresis by R11).\nThen U3B holds the gate low and U4B shorts VSET, so the charger falls back to 5 V:\n1/16 of the heater power, even with Q1 failed short."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 159.385 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d158683f-4921-5cbd-9edb-47eb276c53e6")
	)
	(text "Thermostat"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.145 180.594 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2789f126-9d11-536d-b4b2-bae59055a190")
	)
	(text "RV1 sets the temperature: 43 °C fully anticlockwise, 121 °C fully clockwise.\nHeater off above the set point, on again 0.9 K below it (R10).\nRV1's position (pos, 0 to 1) is the trimmer's travel: 0.535 is 100 °C."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 71.12 222.885 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5516b9cc-a6c4-5f95-9ea2-f1c0d748f072")
	)
	(text "Heater and switch"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 194.945 155.194 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1db8fb3f-13cb-56f4-99a6-205d6a1494a1")
	)
	(text "HTR1 is the heater trace: 9.0 Ω at 20 °C, rising with the plate temperature.\nR2 and the gate charge of Q1 set the switching edges.\nR105 = 0.01 makes Q1 a failed, shorted switch (1G: no fault)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 195.58 217.805 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "70f4616e-6ea8-5c9e-b1a4-52109f3a1d51")
	)
	(text "Plate temperature (ramp)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 161.925 19.304 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "962c5ae7-557f-548f-bd74-c040aed15f13")
	)
	(text "V103 is the plate temperature, 1 V = 1 °C:\n0 to 150 °C in 15 s and back down.\nOn the way up the temperature is 10 × the time,\non the way down 10 × (30 s − time).\nRT1, RT2 and the heater trace follow it."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 193.04 48.26 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e020ae1f-ee3b-502a-bc5e-9fc1234afe97")
	)
	(text "Simulation"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 291.465 105.664 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9f4ecfa7-3986-5cc2-9366-c0d285e6f8f6")
	)
	(text ".tran 2m 30 0 5m"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 292.1 113.03 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6307246e-0d76-599b-a50b-2bdeb39ddd33")
	)
	(text "Inspect > Simulator, then Run. The plate temperature is 10 × the time on the way up.\nGATE high: heater on. LIM_N low: limiter tripped, VBUS falls to 5 V.\nWith the Tune tool: RV1 turns the trimmer, V102 is the 3.3 V rail.\nThe comparator model and its limits: sim/models/heater_sim.lib."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 292.1 121.92 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "dc6b1794-ae24-58ae-9587-1bd39c373d19")
	)
